{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36587","headline":"秋晓寄友人 · 罗隐","name":"秋晓寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭霜落水云秋，又泛轻涟任去留。\n世界高谈今已得，宦途清贵旧曾游。\n手中彩笔夸题凤，天上泥封奖狎鸥。\n更见南来钓翁说，醉吟还上木兰舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}